OL,4,CDec Donnelly says I'm a Celebrity      
OL,5,Ctension 'became much bigger deal than  
OL,6,Cit should have'                        
OL,7,GI'm a Celebrity... Get Me Out of Here  
OL,8,Ghost Declan Donnelly has said tensions 
OL,9,Gbetween Mariella Frostrup and AJ Odudu 
OL,10,Gover cooking duties on the show        
OL,11,G"became a much bigger deal than it     
OL,12,Gshould have".                          
OL,14,FCo-host Ant McPartlin said "cooking    
OL,15,Fmakes things very tense in camp",      
OL,16,Fadding: "If they could zoom out a      
OL,17,Flittle bit in there, they'll realise   
OL,18,Fit's not that deep. But they just      
OL,19,Fcan't, once they're in there".         
